    "title": "Kansas man charged with assault, resisting arrest in Saline County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Taya White ,\n11 hours ago SALINE COUNTY — A Kansas man is facing multiple charges stemming from an incident in Saline County Monday night. Felony charges filed against Dwayne Ahmire Nixon include assault of a special victim, resisting arrest and disarming a peace officer. He also faces misdemeanor charges of fourth-degree assault and careless and imprudent driving. Read full article",
